WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,400
I'm afraid there's no way to hint at paying the rent.

2
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:04,800
Not as good as this

3
00:00:04,800 --> 00:00:06,200
I'll make money first

4
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:08,000
Wait until you make enough money

5
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:10,400
How about I stay in your community again?

6
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:12,400
Why does something sound wrong?

7
00:00:12,400 --> 00:00:14,800
Are you making some crooked ideas?

8
00:00:14,800 --> 00:00:18,650
How could it be, boss?

9
00:00:18,650 --> 00:00:20,850
I'm a very kind ghost

10
00:00:20,850 --> 00:00:24,400
There's absolutely nothing evil about it.

11
00:00:24,400 --> 00:00:25,800
This is me

12
00:00:25,800 --> 00:00:27,200
Although he is considerate

13
00:00:27,200 --> 00:00:28,600
Don't like to embarrass others

14
00:00:28,600 --> 00:00:30,200
Since you do have difficulties

15
00:00:30,200 --> 00:00:33,400
Then I'll let you go this time.

16
00:00:33,400 --> 00:00:34,530
you remember

17
00:00:34,530 --> 00:00:36,530
I'll only let you go this time
